---
version: 2.0.0
title: compiler__assignment_ending_with_call
---
a, b, c = 1, fun()

------------------------------

function main(...) --from line 1 to line 1
    LOADCONSTANT in: 1, constant: 1
    SETGLOBAL name: a, to: 1
    GETGLOBAL to: 2, name: fun
    CALL function: 2, arg_count: 0, result_count: 2
    SETGLOBAL name: b, to: 2
    SETGLOBAL name: c, to: 3
end
